<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>DSA Assignment 1 - Graph Algorithms</title>

<style>
:root {
  font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
  color: #172033;
  background: #f4f7fb;
}

